The '''Nanth flatlands''' were a location on the [[swamp]] [[planet]] of [[Mimban]]. [[Iasento]] was the leader of a [[Mimbanese]] [[Iasento's tribe|tribe]] in the Nanth flatlands before the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="TOG" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Nanth flatlands were first mentioned in the [[2018]] reference book ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]'' written by [[Pablo Hidalgo]].<ref name="TOG" />

